@BASE_URL = https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com 

### ===== GET / =====

### 정상 - 기본
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products

### 정상 - 쿼리 전체
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products?keyword=테스트&page=1&limit=5&sort=recent

### 에러 - page 문자열
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products?page=abc

### 에러 - page 음수
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products?page=-1

### 에러 - limit 소수
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products?limit=1.5

### 에러 - sort 잘못된 값
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products?sort=popular


### ===== GET /:id =====

### 정상
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products/62

### 에러 - 문자열 id
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products/abc

### 에러 - 음수 id
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products/-1

### 에러 - 존재하지 않는 id
GET https://one3-sprint-mission-be-1.onrender.com/products/99999


### ===== POST / =====

### 정상 - tags 포함
